    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is11">
        <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e98">Caput 11</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_1@1-3">Et egredietur virga.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e113">Usque ad principium visionis Babylonis, prophetia est de Christo, quam per partes explanamus, ne lectoris memoriam confundamus.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_1@2-2">Egredietur.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e121"><seg type="qs">Virgam et florem Judaei ipsum Christum interpretantur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et tu es Filius meus primogenitus, qui regnas in sempiternum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e130">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e132">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e134">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e136" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_2@1-2">Et requiescet.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e139"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e140" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e143">Quia in ipso habitat omnis plenitudo Divinitatis.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_2@5-5">Spiritus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e151"><seg type="qs">Sicut sermo Domini, lux, vita et resurrectio <pb ed="#P" n="1250C"/> vocatur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hi sunt septem oculi in lapide uno secundum Zachariam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e162">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e164">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e166">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e168" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_3@1-4">Et replebit eum spiritus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e171"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e172" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e175">Spiritualiter propter parvulos qui timore indigent, quem foras mittit perfecta charitas. Qui enim timet, poenam habet, et non est perfectus in charitate.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e178">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e180" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_3@7-8">Non secundum.</quote>
            Non accipiet personam, quia non est personarum acceptor Deus, sed in omni gente; qui timet Deum acceptus est illi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e184">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e186" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_3@16-16">Arguet.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e189"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e190" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e193">Pharisaeos et reprehendentes apotolos, quando in sabbato ambulantes per sata, spicas vellentes manibus confricabant et manducabant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e197">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e199">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e201">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e203" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_4@16-18">Virga oris sui.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e206"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e207" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e210">Potest per virgam sententia judicii intelligi. In principio enim praedicationis <pb ed="#P" n="1250D"/> dixit: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e214" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt3_2@3-8">Poenitentiam agite, appropinquabit enim regnum coelorum;</quote> et subjunxit: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e217" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt7_19@1-12">Omnis arbor quae non facit fructus bonos eradicetur et in ignem mittetur.</quote></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e221">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e223" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_4@23-24">Interficiet impium.</quote>
            Si enim Michael interficiet (ut quidam dicunt), ipse Deus tamen in Michaele hoc faciet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e229">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e231">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e233">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e235" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_5@8-8">Fides.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e238"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e239" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e242">Fideles bene operando adhaerebunt ei qui factus est sapientia, justitia et sanctificatio, qui ait: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e244" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob3_20@5-7">Ego lux et vita.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e249">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e251">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e253">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e255" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_6@2-4">Lupus cum agno.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e258"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e259" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e262">Paulus cum Petro, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e264" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen49_27@1-3">Benjamin lupus rapax.</quote> Et: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e267">Pasce oves meas. Habitabit lupus cum agno.</quote> Non agnus et haedus habitabant cum lupo et pardo, sed lupus et <pb ed="#P" n="1251A"/> pardus, agni et haedi imitantur innocentiam, scilicet Christum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e273">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e275" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_6@1-2">Habitabit lupus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e278"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e279" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e282"><seg type="qs">Judaei nostri judaizantes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nihil malum, nisi turpitudinem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e290">
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e292" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/is11_6@1-2"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e294"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e295" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e298"><seg type="qs">Vitulus et ovis humiles et innocentes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hoc praestet Ecclesia in mundo.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e307">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e309">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e311">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e313" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_7@10-12">Leo quasi bos,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e316"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e317" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e320">Principes enim hujus saeculi et simplices alii historiae superficie sunt contenti; triticum enim et medullam, id est, interiorem sensum non intelligunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e324">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e326">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e328">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e330" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_8@3-3">Infans.</quote>
            Christus, vel apostoli, malitia parvuli, sensu perfecti: qui daemones ejiciebant de corporibus obsessis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e334">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e336" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_8@12-12">Reguli.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e339"><seg type="qs">Regulus, rex omnium serpentium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de obsessis corporibus scilicet.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e347">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1251B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e351" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_8@16-16">Manum.</quote>
            Id est, divinam potentiam in comprehensum exinde aspidem vel regulum, id est, diabolum, tradet captivum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e356">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e358">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e360">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e362" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_9@11-12">Quia repleta.</quote>
            More suo, in fine prophetalia verba panduntur, ne ad litteram accipiantur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e367">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e369">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e371">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e373" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_10@6-9">Qui stat in signum,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e376"><seg type="qs">unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e379" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc2_34@11-26">Ecce positus est hic in ruinam, et in resurrectionem multorum in Israel, et in signum cui contradicetur</quote>. LXX: Qui consurget ut sit princeps</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">idem significat sepulcrum. Pro dormitione et requie, altero verbo, sed eodem sensu, <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e385" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_10@16-16">sepulcrum</quote> vertimus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e392">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e394">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e396">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e398" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_11@13-13">Residuum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e401"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e402" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e405">Apostolus: <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e407" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom9_27@14-16">Reliquiae salvae fient.</quote> Tradunt enim historiae quod apostoli <pb ed="#P" n="1251C"/> toto orbe diffusi praedicaverunt Evangelium: et quidem Persas, Indosque penetraverunt, ut Aethiopia manum daret Deo.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e415">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e417">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e419">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e421" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_12@3-3">Signum.</quote>
            Crucis, in qua est victoria, ut sciant omnes in quo diabolus sit victus.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e425">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e427" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_12@14-16">A quatuor plagis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e430"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e431" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e434"><seg type="qs">Hoc in Pentecosten videtur impletum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut totius mundi vocatio demonstretur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e443">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e445">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e447">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e449" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_13@1-2">Et auferetur,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e452"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e453" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e456">Quando Isaias hoc praedicebat, inter duas et decem tribus discordia inexorabilis erat, credentes autem pacificati sunt in fide Christi et unitate charitatis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e460">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e462">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e464">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e466" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_14@15-16">Praeceptum manus,</quote>
            etc. Quod praecipiunt operantur; et verbo docent, et exemplo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is11-Dd1e471">
          <head xml:id="gom-is11-Hd1e473">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e475">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e477" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_15@4-5">Linguam maris.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is11-Rd1e480"><name xml:id="gom-is11-Nd1e481" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e484">Quae idola laudabat. <pb ed="#P" n="1251D"/> Mare, id est, populus Aegypti, (qui super omnes idola colit,) ut Deum laudet et timeat, et idola condemnet et abijciat.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e490">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e492" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_15@7-8">Et levabit.</quote>
            Ut Idumaea, et Moab, et filii Ammon tradent manus apostolis, sic et Aegyptii.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e496">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e498" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_15@17-18">Et percutiet.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e501"><seg type="qs">Id est, minuet pro uno septem principes ponendo</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut siccis pedibus transirent.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is11-d1e509">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e511" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_15@24-27">Ut transeant per eum,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-is11-Qd1e514"><seg type="qs">Sub metaphora, Nilus divisus et in partes caesus dicitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Domino Evangelio viam praeparante.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
